{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/J3WTVYTSdIl2FPL8niZvng","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:27.085247+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/J3WTVYTSdIl2FPL8niZvng","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2qazWIiaQ5IIJT0O3RNicJLxZnuZsvCLHcCphBezQg5gxy2vDXd42ktMyetib9RABibSz59YXR6AClIbZecHGK6YSS9tA0jUJbI7c/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3MrhKUnP9rS00mHhicuPkDrEVAGv4KpQzAFnIfrBSllibORuNvxUYia4iaNgOmBqpjsFOEUFe0zvNl37ibZYoxaC9uGcZ2SbicoZWPk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>南京理工大学外国语学院</span></strong></span><span>，前身为中国人民解放军军事工程学院炮兵工程系翻译室。现有英语（国家一流专业建设点，软科中国大学专业排名前15%）、日语、语言学（校友会中国大学语言学专业排名（研究型）前3强）三个本科专业，外国语言文学一级学科硕士点以及翻译硕士（MTI）专业学位点，硕士招生专业有英语语言文学（050201）、俄语语言文学（050202）、日语语言文学（050205）、外国语言学及应用语言学（050211）、英语笔译（055101），学生培养均在</span><span><strong><span>钟山校区</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>学院建有“语言信息处理与言语康复应用”工信部重点实验室、国家民委“一带一路”国别与区域研究中心（白俄罗斯研究中心）、长三角语料库与数据驱动教学研究协同创新、日本研究中心、 “一带一路”语言文化传播战略研究中心等研究平台，外国语言文学获批“十四五”江苏省重点学科。近年来，学院教师在国际重要检索SCI、SSCI、A&amp;HCI、CSSCI期刊等发表论文百余篇；出版专著</span><strong><em><span><span>40</span></span></em></strong><span>部（其中外文专著</span><strong><em><span><span>8</span></span></em></strong><span>部）；共获批国家级和省部级课题</span><strong><em><span><span>40</span></span></em></strong><span>多项；获江苏省哲社成果二等奖</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>项，三等奖</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>项。</span></p><p><span>学院现有教职工</span><strong><em><span><span>99</span></span></em></strong><span>人，其中教授</span><strong><em><span><span>7</span></span></em></strong><span>人，副教授</span><strong><em><span><span>24</span></span></em></strong><span>人，博士生导师</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、硕士生导师</span><strong><em><span><span>28</span></span></em></strong><span>人，具有博士学位教师</span><strong><em><span><span>45</span></span></em></strong><span>人，具有海外博士学位教师</span><strong><em><span><span>18</span></span></em></strong><span>人，另外每年聘请</span><strong><em><span><span>10</span></span></em></strong><span>余名外国专家或外籍教师来学院任教。学院现有江苏省教学名师、江苏省“青蓝工程”中青年学术带头人、“333高层次人才培养工程”第三层次培养对象、江苏省“双创博士”、江苏省社科优青等省部级高水平人才</span><strong><em><span><span>10</span></span></em></strong><span>人。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t10w8O7vZy990Kru6wI4Bbp0kEjOaEH2BT8WZPPUHF6LUQ0kKicrr2mJeQyGdCkOlNvj1jtDS6C1wrevWk7jF0n62pnnqIX4ul8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0hCfQzGia0siaQIufSuffbO8QtN9cM5GS3YdsO2qCMXZQNWETXYzxbXy4ajNt2ETA3uib7WEnGz4xkenKrFJFAFamDoxozyibKia9Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0nFk437DLgAxldasfTBZ3ARgFJJRcd7U71Fks7GA5UXjUQVgDddDXW3rkBNiarkqfGntF1LBc2wkrjsMlMbOSia8RIfib0sxdJEk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1enEujBIyX8WP8YoqmSExCOIMpiciazKvTMkkMFL4iaUBq8ek1mxo2QSpqndHgHHhQR2x6IJPBzl27hzmM27RkQAvRwQYIibNLiaNE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1sDjL6mGQD6Du5FEsArfRLFcNHicJNZkOrjs9KrkNoLlfrqynibKUicIVHlxPNtQarC56j5ENI9naSpb59yUgwggeVibiamppbcWeE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3HemxNVbtdIZIFNlFHPXTCI1y4yv8OrAvCjSmV2pTRtm0Q0D0rjyqmrFicAPf6yc9NpbDaoz9zXxrxFXW9dQIrBtb8UBkCSaZ4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3Sdj7Ko9TgNkrALy20s6PRLeCjhmbOrTBCxV82ch4mSH2KhFqtFicl9eEqYfwmJVTxRBPEIQxjTgMLqdUY5FMA1MficX5ANlkXA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月7日-7月14日</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国本科院校四年制三年级在校生（2027年应届毕业生），本科专业为外国语言文学及相关专业；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人对外国语言文学相关专业研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>4</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息，由学院进行资格审核，7月16日在外国语学院网站公示参加开放日的人员名单，不另行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人需在7月14日之前将下列材料发送至邮箱youying26_sfsnjust@126.com，邮件主题命名格式为：“姓名-本科院校-报考专业-联系方式”。</span></p><p><span>（1）校园开放日活动申请表（研究生院报名系统中导出，要求信息填写完备，并由所在单位</span><span><strong><span>签章</span></strong></span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（2）近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科阶段历年成绩单（须加盖教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式；</span></p><p><span>（4）有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作；</span></p><p><span>（5）其他相关的附件材料。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次校园开放日日程为7月21日。活动内容包括学院及专业情况介绍、奖学金相关政策讲解、“语言信息处理与言语康复应用”工信部重点实验室云参观、导师研究前沿报告及师生互动交流等。具体安排如下：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2jBovA86PTH9B7RrwIkvP7Gc0wWoNnQpP00VYnhTgnCLFv7haMsQFZgnggUF5UtkErMK6QlsLY2pS4TdZrJcVPiaiaKLdpc5Erc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）校园开放日活动不收取任何费用。</span></p><p><span>（2）登录开放日平台后，要求全程参加活动。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>王老师（手机15588208930）</span></span></p><p><span>韩老师（手机13915982879）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子邮箱</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>youying26_sfsnjust@126.com</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0jnXgFu4dAWpp4TAyfT14n0SSe4ooroHAoscYblNeUIW3Bx9FrmDdApcSt23tX0LJoyLUOdP4MJT5hO6hiagk7sXmCPiadzXibh4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 外国语学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 吴雅琪</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 外国语学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 于雷</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0KH3EFibX3KUhFibjG2dEh4U5xbkusic4RN0pxrZaZENhCsskSPxjZquwfhhCrwZxb4NWT3foZmSItEahkQoOBRqzcKicYAk1XBow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"657c48da79f34cd3873e41ccc038f752185bb3294852e1ffc5c6d7eeaccca54c","textLength":1435,"sourceSha256":"cc321051d8ce19da708ff59bf7ba08f9fd744797c9e465562cf62dbb3b93fc15","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a93a5b8b4cdce022baac","title":"2026年南京理工大学外国语学院2026年全国“优秀大学生”校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:27.085247+00:00"}
